      "content": "that makes sense. i actually saw a guy yesterday just standing by his car for like 10 minutes, just staring at the street, but he had a phone in his hand like he was busy. it felt so fake. i'm starting to get really paranoid that even my friends might be part of it, like they're just actors in this whole thing. how do i tell if someone i know is actually being themselves or if they've been assigned to monitor me?",
